{"step_index":122,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:17:19Z","thinking":"**Crafting the Injection Script**\n\nI'm now focused on the JavaScript injection script. I've considered how to handle the \"allow pasting\" prompt in Chrome and Edge's DevTools. The key is to check for the warning and automatically type \"allow pasting\" before proceeding.\n\n\n**Refining the Injection Strategy**\n\nI've determined the best approach involves sending \"allow pasting\" followed by Enter, then the script. This method cleanly addresses the console's paste restrictions in Chrome and Edge. Moving on, I'm integrating auto-next logic using periodic timers and DOM checks. These timers will look for and click next buttons, handle paused or ended video elements and supress alerts to maintain continuous operation. I'm now exploring the optimal mute options. My next step will be to create a PowerShell runner to handle compilation and injection.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"PowerShell script to trigger injection and capture verification screenshot","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"Add-Type -ReferencedAssemblies System.Drawing, System.Windows.Forms -Path \"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\44470555-939d-4160-8744-09bb2f099064\\scratch\\AutoInjector.cs\"\n\n$js = @\"\n(function autoNextDreamCampus() {\n    console.log('%c[DreamCampus Auto-Next Active]', 'color: #00ff00; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;');\n    window.alert = function(msg) { console.log('[Alert Suppressed]:', msg); return true; };\n\n    setInterval(() => {\n        try {\n            // 1. Next lesson popup\n            const nextTimeBtn = document.querySelector('.jconfirm-buttons .btn-purple, .jconfirm-buttons button');\n            if (nextTimeBtn && (nextTimeBtn.innerText.includes('다음 차시') || nextTimeBtn.innerText.includes('확인'))) {\n                console.log('[Auto-Next] Clicking next lesson button');\n                nextTimeBtn.click();\n                return;\n            }\n\n            // 2. iframe media check\n            const iframe = document.getElementById('iframe');\n            if (iframe && iframe.contentWindow) {\n                const iframeDoc = iframe.contentDocument || iframe.contentWindow.document;\n                if (iframeDoc) {\n                    const media = iframeDoc.querySelector('video, audio');\n                    if (media) {\n                        if (media.paused && media.currentTime === 0) {\n                            media.play().catch(() => {});\n                        }\n                        if (media.ended || (media.duration > 0 && media.currentTime >= media.duration - 0.5)) {\n                            const nextBtn = document.getElementById('page_next');\n                            if (nextBtn) {\n                                console.log('[Auto-Next] Video ended -> Clicking #page_next');\n                                nextBtn.click();\n                            }\n                        }\n                        return;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            // 3. Slide page check\n            const nextBtn = document.getElementById('page_next');\n            if (nextBtn && nextBtn.classList.contains('arrow')) {\n                console.log('[Auto-Next] Arrow active -> Clicking #page_next');\n                nextBtn.click();\n            }\n        } catch (e) {}\n    }, 1500);\n})();\n\"@\n\n# Also allow pasting just in case DevTools prompts for it\n[AutoInjector]::InjectAutoScript(\"allow pasting\")\nStart-Sleep -Milliseconds 300\n[AutoInjector]::InjectAutoScript($js)\n\nStart-Sleep -Seconds 2\n[AutoInjector]::CaptureWindow(\"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\44470555-939d-4160-8744-09bb2f099064\\scratch\\after_inject.png\")\n","Description":"Runner to inject auto-next script and capture verification image","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\44470555-939d-4160-8744-09bb2f099064\\scratch\\run_inject.ps1","toolAction":"Writing run_inject.ps1","toolSummary":"Create run_inject.ps1"}}]}
